      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "Looks a race in two. DANGEROUS (9) drew poorly and had to race wide and work in the Victoria Cup last start so prepared to overlook that result. Had kicked off his campaign with back-to-back wins at this circuit and distance, both from wider draws than this. Big chance to return to the winners' list but it won't be easy to overcome his stablemate HI MANAMEISJEFF NZ (7). He placed in his first two starts of a spell, getting within 6m of wonder mare Captains Mistress two back, before coming from wider than this for a 2.5m win at this circuit and distance last time. Strong chance to back that up. ROYAL CRUISER (8) only beat one home last start but that was his first outing for a year so it should have improved him. He can show more tonight. SAINT CRUSADER (3) and CAPTAIN BELLASARIO (4) both draw well enough to be exotic hopes.",
